  "result": [
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "0",
        "end": "0",
        "startOffset": 49,
        "endOffset": 60,
        "text": "being tough",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2C74C80E04",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "0",
        "end": "0",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 61,
        "text": "When we think about negotiations, we think about being tough.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "799DC3C73E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "1",
        "end": "1",
        "startOffset": 13,
        "endOffset": 31,
        "text": "like it's a battle",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2D2C37BD36",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "1",
        "end": "1",
        "startOffset": 33,
        "endOffset": 78,
        "text": "brandishing our influence and our power moves",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7543E29DDB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "1",
        "end": "1",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 79,
        "text": "We charge in like it's a battle, brandishing our influence and our power moves.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C5F65E65FF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "2",
        "end": "2",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 69,
        "text": "But a negotiation doesn't have to be a fight with winners and losers.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B6A95BF5DD",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "3",
        "end": "3",
        "startOffset": 17,
        "endOffset": 29,
        "text": "like a dance",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CFE7468B6E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "3",
        "end": "3",
        "startOffset": 50,
        "endOffset": 72,
        "text": "moving fluidly in sync",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "36DFFCBB2F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "3",
        "end": "3",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 124,
        "text": "Think of it more like a dance, two or more people moving fluidly in sync. [The Way We Work] We constantly negotiate at work.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "32B5E0C0BD",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 17,
        "endOffset": 76,
        "text": "higher pay, promotions, vacations and even greater autonomy",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E3A2A24E7A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 77,
        "text": "We negotiate for higher pay, promotions, vacations and even greater autonomy.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "099E53B517",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 109,
        "text": "In fact, every day we negotiate just to get our job done and to secure resources for ourselves and our teams.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7271885D8A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "6",
        "end": "6",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 101,
        "text": "And yet when we go in with the wrong mindset, with a fist up ready to fight, we aren't as successful.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3930C3A089",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 13,
        "text": "You know why?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "611D56BAAA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "8",
        "end": "8",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 44,
        "text": "Because negotiation is not about dominating.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E6EFCD46AE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "9",
        "end": "9",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 35,
        "text": "It's about crafting a relationship.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B5605B8582",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 46,
        "endOffset": 90,
        "text": "give and to take and move together in unison",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "729260D0C7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 91,
        "text": "And relationships thrive when we find ways to give and to take and move together in unison.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AA4B668161",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 16,
        "endOffset": 44,
        "text": "you have to be well prepared",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2DA26020F2",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 45,
        "text": "And to do that, you have to be well prepared.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "48633E8252",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "12",
        "end": "12",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 24,
        "text": "First, do your research.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4F4A03CA21",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 55,
        "text": "Figure out whether what you're asking for is realistic.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CEBD0DDC2D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "14",
        "end": "14",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 24,
        "text": "What is your aspiration?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "066ADFF1C8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 16,
        "text": "What do you want",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FF95ED3AA9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 22,
        "endOffset": 66,
        "text": "what will make you walk away from the table?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "21E9891FA7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 68,
        "text": "This might seem obvious, but too many people don’t think it through.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CAF57898BA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 55,
        "text": "Let's say you're negotiating for a salary in a new job.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "92D2DB43A6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "18",
        "end": "18",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 64,
        "text": "Some people, they determine they ask based on their past salary.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "EB42F41F01",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 28,
        "text": "That isn't a good yardstick.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3BF72B3DB8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "20",
        "end": "20",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 49,
        "text": "You may end up asking for too much or too little.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "19DE17FB1A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "21",
        "end": "21",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 48,
        "text": "Instead, find out the range of what is possible.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3D23BC4065",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "22",
        "end": "22",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 37,
        "text": "Look at industrial reports, websites.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C04F5B71CD",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 169,
        "text": "Talk to people in your professional network to find out the lowest, average and the highest salary for a similar role, and then make your ask closer to that upper limit.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "51231869AB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "24",
        "end": "24",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 85,
        "text": "Build a solid rationale for why you are above average and thus deserving of that ask.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F833FEE2F6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "25",
        "end": "25",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 128,
        "text": "Let's say you're negotiating for something less black and white, like the ability to work from home to care for an aging parent.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F5838973C6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "26",
        "end": "26",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 57,
        "text": "You need to study your company's policies on remote work.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B93FD6E7C6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "27",
        "end": "27",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 75,
        "text": "Ask yourself when and why were these policies developed in the first place?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E56FD3B909",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "28",
        "end": "28",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 106,
        "text": "Talk to trusted mentors to understand how working from home might affect issues that aren't on your radar.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C39FC0B9E0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "29",
        "end": "29",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 92,
        "text": "And think about how changing to working from home might actually affect others in your team.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "63605FBB94",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "30",
        "end": "30",
        "startOffset": 47,
        "endOffset": 55,
        "text": "your job",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C58201C584",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "30",
        "end": "30",
        "startOffset": 47,
        "endOffset": 50,
        "text": "you",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B9D5A73BAA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "30",
        "end": "30",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 134,
        "text": "In fact, make a table summarizing the parts of your job that can be done remotely and the parts that require face-to-face interaction.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4C1C43E7D7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 53,
        "endOffset": 59,
        "text": "you're",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "82CED5B2F0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 87,
        "endOffset": 93,
        "text": "you've",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D18B083E82",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 53,
        "endOffset": 56,
        "text": "you",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BF447DE675",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 155,
        "text": "This may sound like a lot to do, but when the person you're negotiating with sees that you've done all this homework, you're more likely to get that \"yes.\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "30DF776BC8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "32",
        "end": "32",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 74,
        "text": "It also helps you avoid being lied to while building the person’s respect.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3BABD02864",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "33",
        "end": "33",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 45,
        "text": "Second, prepare mentally for the negotiation.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5E7AB78B35",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "34",
        "end": "34",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 36,
        "text": "Asking for things can get emotional.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E4128241F4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "35",
        "end": "35",
        "startOffset": 27,
        "endOffset": 35,
        "text": "feelings",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3B9D82B047",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "35",
        "end": "35",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 77,
        "text": "There are real and complex feelings at play: fear, anxiety, anger, even hurt.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "090A555341",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "36",
        "end": "36",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 68,
        "text": "It's essential to have strategies in place to manage those feelings.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "94E4129417",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "37",
        "end": "37",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 58,
        "text": "One strategy is to adopt a mindset of defensive pessimism.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "14268B618E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "38",
        "end": "38",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 83,
        "text": "That just means that you accept obstacles and failures are likely in a negotiation.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2E203AFC8D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "39",
        "end": "39",
        "startOffset": 8,
        "endOffset": 83,
        "text": "better to put your energy in imagining the ways to overcome those obstacles",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "26371377CB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "39",
        "end": "39",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 7,
        "text": "So it's",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7FF24CCE9F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "40",
        "end": "40",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 51,
        "text": "That way, you’re ready to respond when you face it.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C96BBCDC06",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "41",
        "end": "41",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 41,
        "text": "Another strategy is emotional distancing.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "636C298FE1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "42",
        "end": "42",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 64,
        "text": "That is the idea of being less attached to any specific outcome.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "EBBD939673",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "43",
        "end": "43",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 34,
        "text": "I know it's easier said than done.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "77F533164D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "44",
        "end": "44",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 87,
        "text": "We all feel emotions like anger and hurt when our core identities are being threatened.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CD500FD252",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "60",
        "end": "60",
        "startOffset": 27,
        "endOffset": 35,
        "text": "missteps",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FDD84EA724",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "60",
        "end": "60",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 119,
        "text": "So many of our negotiation missteps, they don't actually come from disagreements but misunderstanding the other person.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5AADB001EC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "61",
        "end": "61",
        "startOffset": 34,
        "endOffset": 57,
        "text": "to ask why and why not?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F8E372366D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "61",
        "end": "61",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 57,
        "text": "So it's important to listen well, to ask why and why not?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "371FA9D326",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "62",
        "end": "62",
        "startOffset": 4,
        "endOffset": 7,
        "text": "you",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2AE7A66FBD",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "62",
        "end": "62",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 72,
        "text": "And you will surely find unexpected opportunities for win-win solutions.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "778DEB7165",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "45",
        "end": "45",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 202,
        "text": "When your manager may be challenging a truth that you hold dear about yourself, like you’re a hard worker and you deserve this, try and avoid thinking of negotiations as the ultimate test of your worth.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "INCOMPLETE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CDED08C524",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "46",
        "end": "46",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 120,
        "text": "Go in knowing that your request might be met, that it might be denied, and that none of this is a measure of your worth.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "INCOMPLETE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7B0E255D6E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "47",
        "end": "47",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 99,
        "text": "Also know that if you feel yourself getting upset, hurt during a negotiation, it's OK to step back.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "INCOMPLETE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1C29E4CC4F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "48",
        "end": "48",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 57,
        "text": "You can leave the dance floor and move up to the balcony.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "INCOMPLETE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "04DEC1C5E7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "49",
        "end": "49",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 49,
        "text": "Just say, \"Let me think about this a little more.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "INCOMPLETE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5225030971",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "50",
        "end": "50",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 49,
        "text": "Could we press pause and continue this tomorrow?\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "INCOMPLETE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "21B947D480",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "51",
        "end": "51",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 112,
        "text": "The third and the final way you can prepare for negotiations is by putting yourself in the other person's shoes.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "INCOMPLETE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AEB59BF64B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "52",
        "end": "52",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 63,
        "text": "Taking the time to anticipate the other's needs and challenges.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "INCOMPLETE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AAD4908DF6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "53",
        "end": "53",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 33,
        "text": "What pressures may they be under?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "INCOMPLETE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "67161A60EC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "54",
        "end": "54",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 32,
        "text": "What risks would they be taking?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "INCOMPLETE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "ACDBAA5BFF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "55",
        "end": "55",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 63,
        "text": "Do they even have the power to give you what you're asking for?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "INCOMPLETE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A1E1E3CDF8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "56",
        "end": "56",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 39,
        "text": "What ripple effects might a \"yes\" mean?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "INCOMPLETE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7501BF1AA3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "57",
        "end": "57",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 108,
        "text": "When you make that request, look to balance assertiveness about your own needs with a concern for the other.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "INCOMPLETE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "899B0669BE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "58",
        "end": "58",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 102,
        "text": "As you lay out your case, use phrases like, “I’m asking for this because I know it’s good for my team.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "INCOMPLETE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7575A26607",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "59",
        "end": "59",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 181,
        "text": "That I want to achieve X and Y goals, and I know this is what will enable it.” Arguments like that show that you are ambitious, you know what you want, but you also care for others.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "INCOMPLETE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CFF6A9978D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    }
  ]
}